Subject: [PATCH 1055/3799] soh: rename func_808BA2CC -> BgTokiHikari_DrawBeam

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the params 1 draw path: draws a beam at a fixed point in front of the Door of Time, stretched and coloured by the fading intensity. Named for its shape and placement; the display lists it uses are unnamed.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Toki_Hikari/z_bg_toki_hikari.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
